<title>USA: FINOVA Capital Corp issues $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>FINOVA Capital Corp issues $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from FINOVA Capital Corp was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>FINOVA Capital Corp is the principal subsidiary of the commercial finance company FINOVA Group Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER FINOVA CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 5/17/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.429  FIRST PAY DATE 11/17/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Baa1  YIELD 7.23 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 58 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
